    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀβᾰθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάθος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not deep,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάλαγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					5.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>in single rank,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐφ᾽ ἑνὸς ἀ. τάξις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				17.5
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.127
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Geom.,
				<i>without depth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιφάνεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.43
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				572.25
			</span></i>.</div>
